{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:*Qo","text":"id","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerenergyconfiguration\/init"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/init"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"init","modules":[{"name":"ScanbotSDK"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"c:@M@ScanbotSDK@objc(cs)SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration(im)init"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration/init":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/init","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerenergyconfiguration\/init","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"}],"title":"init","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[]},"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The energy management configuration object for a ‘SBSDKBaseScannerViewController’ and its subclasses."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"‘SBSDKBaseScannerViewController’ and subclasses sport a customizable energy management system."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Since scanners running on a live video feed can put a lot of load onto the CPU and\/or GPU"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the device, causing the battery to drain quickly and running the device hot, you can customize the energy"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consumption using this class by configuring the rate of detections\/recognitions per second in performance mode as","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"well as in energy saving mode."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In performance mode the scanners will be fed with a higher, configurable rate of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"video frames per second."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"After a certain, configurable period of inactivity the energy save mode will be engaged and the rate","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of scans will be reduced to a lower (configurable) rate."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"You can also configure the time of inactivity before the automatic mode switches from performance to energy save mode.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Inactivity here means that both of the following conditions are met:","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerenergyconfiguration","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"ScanbotSDK","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Version: 7.0.0"}],"url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk"}},"variantOverrides":[{"patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"\/references\/doc:~1~1net.doo.ScanbotSDK~1documentation~1ScanbotSDK~1SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/title","value":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration"},{"value":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration"}],"op":"replace","path":"\/references\/doc:~1~1net.doo.ScanbotSDK~1documentation~1ScanbotSDK~1SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/fragments"},{"op":"replace","value":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration"}],"path":"\/references\/doc:~1~1net.doo.ScanbotSDK~1documentation~1ScanbotSDK~1SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/navigatorTitle"}],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}]}